# 📚 Course Management System

A backend-driven **Course Management System** built using **Spring Boot, Spring Data JPA, Hibernate, and PostgreSQL**.  
This project follows clean layered architecture and demonstrates real-world backend development practices.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Student Registration
- Student Login
- Course Management
- Student Enrollment into Courses
- Backend-driven validations
- Automatic table creation using Hibernate
- RESTful APIs
- PostgreSQL database integration

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate
- PostgreSQL
- Maven
- REST APIs
- Postman

